ly on one project that import different microservices inside one single project. I tried also to debug it but without any success. It seams somthing inside io.quarkus.arc.generator.Default_jakarta_enterprise_context_ApplicationScoped_ContextInstances but i can see the source of it. \r\nUsing  quarkus.arc.optimize-contexts=false everything works fine so @Ladicek  could hava a clue how to check it or why it happens.  ","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/1872099144/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"psini","id":392536,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MjUzNg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/392536?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini","html_url":"https://github.com/psini","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":11356996058,"node_id":"MEE_lADOCFbutM56vbKmzwAAAAKk7gHa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/events/11356996058","actor":{"login":"Ladicek","id":480590,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MDU5MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/480590?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ladicek","html_url":"https://github.com/Ladicek","followers_u