https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/1872152036","html_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/37958#issuecomment-1872152036","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/37958","id":1872152036,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCFbutM5vlsXk","user":{"login":"psini","id":392536,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MjUzNg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/392536?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini","html_url":"https://github.com/psini","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-12-29T15:01:31Z","updated_at":"2023-12-29T15:03:06Z","body":"I have done some troubleshooting and found the culprit . I used applicationscoped beans and injectedthem in the test code that is running on main thread. \r\nIn one of those beans I had a postconstrunct that do a rest call to the app running on quarkus that has to initialize other beans like OidcAuthenticationMechanism but the lock inside Default_jakarta_enterprise_context_ApplicationScoped_ContextInstances is only one for every bean so it creates a deadlock because the vertx thread that want to init OidcAuthenticationMechanism should wait the lock to be realesed from the creation of the test class on main but it will never happen.\r\nLet me know if you need more info. A possible solution is have a lock inside Default_jakarta_enterprise_context_ApplicationScoped_ContextInstances for each kind of bean and not one for everithing.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/1872152036/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"psini","id":392536,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MjUzNg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/392536?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini","html_url":"https://github.com/psini","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psini/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/1872161017","html_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/37958#issuecomment-1872161017","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/37958","id":1872161017,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCFbutM5vluj5","user":{"login":"sberyozkin","id":467639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzYzOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/467639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sberyozkin","html_url":"https://github.com/sberyozkin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sberyozkin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sberyozkin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https